{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: Agent基础概念MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent 的自我反思（Reflection）机制是什么？Reflexion 框架如何实现？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent基础概念\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> medium\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/基础概念\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent 的反思（Reflection）机制是什么？Reflexion 框架的核心原理和实现方式是什么？为什么反思对 Agent 很重要？</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"1. 答案\" dir=\"auto\">1. 答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>反思机制概述：</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">反思（Reflection）是 Agent <strong>对自身的工作、输出或决策过程进行评估，并利用评估结果来改进后续行为</strong>的机制。它引入了反馈循环，使 Agent 不仅仅生成输出，还会审视该输出，识别问题并优化。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>为什么反思很重要：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>自我纠错</strong>：发现并修正自己的错误</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>持续改进</strong>：从失败经验中学习，避免重复犯错</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>质量保证</strong>：在输出给用户前进行质量检查</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>适应性</strong>：根据环境反馈调整策略</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>反思的两种实现模式：</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>模式一：Basic Reflection（基础反思）</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">两个独立 Agent 形成闭环：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Generator（生成器）</strong>：负责产生初始输出</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Reflector（评估器）</strong>：负责批判性评估并提供改进建议</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">BasicReflection</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"基础反思模式：生成器 + 评估器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> generator_llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> reflector_llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_iterations<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generator <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> generator_llm\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>reflector <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> reflector_llm\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>max_iterations <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> max_iterations\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">run</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        current_output <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generator<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">range</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>max_iterations<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 评估器进行批判性评估</span>\n            critique <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>reflector<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"\n                原始任务：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n                当前输出：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>current_output<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n                \n                请批判性地评估这个输出：\n                1. 是否完整回答了问题？\n                2. 是否有事实错误？\n                3. 是否有遗漏的信息？\n                4. 如何改进？\n                \n                请提供具体的改进建议。\n            \"\"\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 检查是否通过评估</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"通过\"</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> critique <span class=\"token keyword\">or</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"完美\"</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> critique<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">break</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 生成器根据反馈改进</span>\n            current_output <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generator<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"\n                原始任务：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n                之前的输出：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>current_output<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n                改进建议：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>critique<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n                \n                请根据建议改进输出。\n            \"\"\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> current_output\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>模式二：Reflexion 框架</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">来自论文《Reflexion: Language Agents with Verbal Reinforcement Learning》，由三个模块组成：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ReflexionFramework</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n    Reflexion 强化学习框架\n    Actor + Evaluator + Self-Reflection\n    \"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>actor <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Actor<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>           <span class=\"token comment\"># 执行者：生成文本和行动</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>evaluator <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Evaluator<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>   <span class=\"token comment\"># 评估者：计算奖励分数</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>self_reflection <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> SelfReflection<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 自我反思</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>reflection_memory <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>    <span class=\"token comment\"># 反思经验库（长期记忆）</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">run</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_trials<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> trial <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">range</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>max_trials<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. Actor 执行任务（参考之前的反思经验）</span>\n            trajectory <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>actor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>act<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                task<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                reflections<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>reflection_memory  <span class=\"token comment\"># 注入历史反思</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. Evaluator 评估轨迹质量</span>\n            reward<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> feedback <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>evaluator<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>evaluate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> trajectory<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 检查是否成功</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>is_success<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>reward<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> trajectory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>final_answer\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. Self-Reflection 生成语言化反思</span>\n            reflection <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>self_reflection<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                trajectory<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>trajectory<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                reward<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>reward<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                feedback<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>feedback\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            \n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 存储反思到长期记忆</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>reflection_memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>reflection<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 返回最佳尝试的结果</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> trajectory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>final_answer\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">is_success</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> reward<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"判断任务是否成功\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">isinstance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>reward<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> reward <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>success_threshold\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> reward  <span class=\"token comment\"># 布尔值</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Evaluator 的评估方式（按任务类型）：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>任务类型</th>\n<th>评估方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>决策任务</td>\n<td>启发式规则或环境二元信号（成功/失败）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编程任务</td>\n<td>单元测试验证代码正确性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推理任务</td>\n<td>基于精确匹配（EM）评分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对话任务</td>\n<td>LLM 评估或人工反馈</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>反思 Prompt 模板：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">REFLECTION_PROMPT <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n你正在回顾自己之前的行动，以改进未来的决策。\n\n之前的任务：{task}\n你采取的行动：{actions}\n结果：{result}\n评估反馈：{feedback}\n\n请反思：\n1. 你之前的策略有什么问题？\n2. 你忽略了什么重要信息？\n3. 下次遇到类似情况应该怎么做？\n\n用1-2句话总结你的反思，这个反思将在未来任务中指导你的决策。\n\"\"\"</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>反思的应用场景：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>代码审查</strong>：生成代码后自动检查 bug</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>论文润色</strong>：生成内容后检查质量</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>SQL 检查</strong>：生成查询后验证正确性</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>方案评审</strong>：生成方案后评估可行性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-heading=\"2. 延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">2. 延伸追问</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：反思和 ReAct 中的 Observation 有什么区别？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：Observation 是外部工具返回的客观结果；Reflection 是 Agent 对自身行为和结果的主动评估和思考。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：反思会增加多少延迟？如何优化？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：每次反思需要额外 LLM 调用。优化：①只对关键步骤反思 ②异步反思 ③缓存反思经验复用</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-heading=\"3. 常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">3. 常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：反思一定会提升性能</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：反思的质量取决于评估标准设计。如果评估标准不清晰，反思可能无效甚至引入负向偏差</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h1 data-heading=\"高级篇\" dir=\"auto\">高级篇</h1>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"1. 相关\" dir=\"auto\">1. 相关</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a> — 返回主题导航</li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}